{"t":"BKNG","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"Booking Holdings Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Travel Services","employees":25850,"hq":"Norwalk, CT, United States","website":"https://www.bookingholdings.com","summary_en":"Booking Holdings Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides online and traditional travel and restaurant reservations and related services in the United States, the Netherlands, the United Kingdom, and internationally. The company operates Booking.com, which offers online accommodation reservations; and Priceline, which provides discount travel reservations services, as well as online accommodation, flight, rental car reservation services, vacation packages, cruises, activity, and affiliate programs. It also operates Agoda that offers online accommodation reservation, flight, ground transportation, and attractions. In addition, the company operates KAYAK, an online meta-search service that allows consumers to search and compare travel itineraries and prices; and OpenTable for booking online restaurant reservations, as well as reservation management services to restaurants. Further, it offers travel-related insurance products, payment facilitation, and restaurant management services to consumers, travel service providers, and restaurants; and advertising services. The company was formerly known as The Priceline Group Inc. and changed its name to Booking Holdings Inc. in February 2018. Booking Holdings Inc. was founded in 1997 and is headquartered in Norwalk, Connecticut.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Booking Holdings Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미국, 네덜란드, 영국 및 해외에서 온라인 및 일반 여행, 레스토랑 예약 및 관련 서비스를 제공합니다. 회사는 온라인 숙박 예약을 제공하는 Booking.com을 운영하고 있습니다. 할인 여행 예약 서비스는 물론 온라인 숙박, 항공권, 렌터카 예약 서비스, 휴가 패키지, 크루즈, 액티비티 및 제휴 프로그램을 제공하는 Priceline. 또한 온라인 숙박 예약, 항공권, 지상 교통, 관광지 등을 제공하는 아고다(Agoda)도 운영하고 있습니다. 또한, 소비자가 여행 일정과 가격을 검색하고 비교할 수 있는 온라인 메타 검색 서비스인 KAYAK을 운영하고 있습니다. 온라인 레스토랑 예약을 위한 OpenTable과 레스토랑 예약 관리 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 소비자, 여행 서비스 제공업체 및 레스토랑에 여행 관련 보험 상품, 결제 촉진 및 레스토랑 관리 서비스를 제공합니다. 및 광고 서비스. 이 회사는 이전에 The Priceline Group Inc.로 알려졌으며 2018년 2월에 Booking Holdings Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Booking Holdings Inc.는 1997년에 설립되었으며 코네티컷주 노워크에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":144.94,"mcap":107792064512.0,"pe":15.720173,"fpe":11.8464775,"peg":0.54,"ps":3.8324707,"pb":-10.389964,"ev_ebitda":11.523,"div":1.16,"beta":1.153,"hi52":220.806,"lo52":144.1},"fin":{"rev":28125999104.0,"rev_g":-0.013,"eps_g":0.068,"gross":0.87179,"op":0.32845002,"net":0.25521,"roe":null,"fcf":7609124864.0,"cash":15813999616.0,"debt":21319000064.0,"de":null,"eps":9.22,"feps":12.23486},"own":{"short":0.0232,"inst":0.97776,"insider":0.00184},"analyst":{"n":34,"mean":215.05882,"median":213.0,"high":267.0,"low":150.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.55556,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":23,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":6,"buy":24,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":6,"buy":26,"hold":7,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":26,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":267.0,"priorPriceTarget":265.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":220.0,"priorPriceTarget":236.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":205.0,"priorPriceTarget":248.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":200.0,"priorPriceTarget":230.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","current